      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, my 4yo has a fever and i'm seeing these tiny little red and purple spots on his legs and tummy. i tried pressing a little glass against them to see if they'd fade but they didn't, they just stay there even under the glass. he's acting mostly fine just a little bit fussy and sleepy, so i'm probably just overreacting right? is it just a normal childhood thing like a heat rash or a minor virus? i really don't want to have to take him to the er tonight if it's nothing serious.",
